/-!
# The exact ledger

The 124 count groups `(N, j)` of the census, with lower bounds for their energy floors, the
raw objective and the final arithmetic. `N` is the number of near neighbours (norm `≤ R₅`) and
`j` the least index with all of them within `R_j` (`nearCount`, `firstRadius` in
`Neighbourhood.lean`). Each floor here is the exact floor in `data/census_floors.json`
(field `profile[].new_floor`) rounded down to a multiple of `10⁻²⁴`, and `urawUp` is the exact
raw objective (`exact_raw_objective`) rounded up. `scripts/check_lean_inputs.py` checks these
roundings.
-/

